    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Yawns)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Spectator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell really knows how to grind gears. A perfectly good art gallery opening and he has to hold it late in the night. Now I'm stuck here, waiting it to finish in the morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I bet Reynell's gonna show us something totally out there, don't you? Why the all-nighter otherwise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. I was looking forward to the street art community festival anyway, and that got cancelled for no reason. I've got nowhere else to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_223",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell's taken the joke too far. Keeping the concrete details of this opening ceremony secret even from high-level partners like us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmph. I suppose playing to the gallery is his literal job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>You</i> think of a joke that manages to drive over half of Terra's art investors scrambling to our Bunkerhill City HQ the way they have for the Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa, and <i>then</i> I'll hear you whine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_223",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yessir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_493_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This Kazimierzian on the brochure... I wonder if his salon really will get a painting or two of mine sold...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Destitute Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_493_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't Leithanien. It's all about your story, whether or not it's enough to excite the investors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you say to leave all that work to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Destitute Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_493_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I kept telling you, dye your hair, learn some profanity, dress in tatty clothes, call yourself a rebel against the rotten system of nobility, and they'll all eat it right up. But you won't do any of that. So what can I even say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll give you one last tip. It can't beat a rebel spirit, but there's people who still like the down-and-out noble as a sell. Whether or not it's enough get the investors stirring all comes down to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, please remain calm. Our opening ceremony is about to commence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PA"
    },
    {
        "text": "Repeat. Ladies and gentlemen, please remain calm. Our opening ceremony is about to commence\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PA"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell saunters up to the podium erected in the Galer\u00eda's front plaza."
    },
    {
        "text": "He calmly surveys the crowd before him a few times, especially the ones in seats closest to him. He confirms to himself that all expected have shown up, and then clears his throat."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, good morning, good afternoon, or good evening\u2014please, take your pick, depending on when you usually sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_applause"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 5
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you to everyone who applauded, and thank you to those who didn't. You have, after all, sacrificed your own precious sleep hours to admire this magnificent dawn with me, here in the City of Two Suns.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your warm welcome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for joining me as together, we make history. A small part of it for sure, and possibly of no note to ages far from now, but to all of you here, it will be one you remember for the rest of your lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_applause"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a smooth talker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
