        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "God save Bol\u00edvar, and God save Dossoles \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our tourists fork out money with their brains full of air \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the future of this city is one and same \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hermano, you need some fresh lyrics. Let me accompany for you, I'll write you something a bit more topical.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Singer"
    },
    {
        "text": "God save the Coalition, and God save Kowalski \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Singer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The army brass gets in bed with all our slumming millionaires \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Singer"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the night when the freak nightmare beast comes to play \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Singer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
