        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, welcome to Dossoles, and welcome to Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we get to the main course, I'd like to introduce to you all this event that marks a new age.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure not all of you are for the Galer\u00eda or the opening ceremony\u2014I'm sure a lot of you sitting there are thinking, 'this is just some forced antic by a Kazimierzian failson.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "You would probably care more for something lucrative, so I have it laid out here before you, to satisfy your curiosity and greed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, please bring out your personal terminals, and raise them high in the air.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cheer_street"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You proclaim yourselves individuals of refined and discerning taste. You keep up with the trends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Portable terminals. An invention to stand with the greats. An escape for people from the guilt of wasted time, bringing news to every corner of every city, connecting them all together as one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's on this rich future vein I'm willing to build a drilling platform in the name of art, and stuff your wallets full with the golden coins and crisp paper bills it gushes forth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is with great pomp and circumstance that I introduce to you this groundbreaking invention, which will soon make waves throughout the intercity net...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Collector's Virtual Art Piece Project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
