    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bro, how come I've never seen you before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about? I live right upstairs from you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sly Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you're that one guy, uh... Pisto?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sly Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you go to get treated though?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who cares? Does getting treated give Reynell the right to storm into our neighborhood and wreck our shit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sly Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn straight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about it? Let's head over to that gallery and throw a real party? Should we go big?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sly Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No duh we go big!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now you're talking! We can't give a guy like that a single inch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sly Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
