    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$tech_intro",
        "key": "$tech_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Collector's Virtual Art Piece? This is what you did with our capital?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, think about it. Soon, some artists will cease to work in paints and brushes. They'll sit before their terminals, creating works for the intercity net that you'll be just as able to invest in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can take any painting in the Galer\u00eda's collection, make a one-for-one copy of it on the intercity net, and you'll be able to see its every detail on your terminals, whenever you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one will be able to steal or duplicate the painting. All rights to the virtual artwork will lie with you. Sell it, destroy it, it's all up to you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014This is blasphemy against art!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that, I'm blaspheming against art? Look at that grizzled, big-bellied investor beside you. If you want blasphemy, well, he's the master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You people don't care what creators conceive or convey, you just want the rights to the interpretation in your greasy grip, to easily manipulate prices against market trends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "You do the same thing, and so does your father!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When have I ever tried to claim that Szczepan Kowalski does not blaspheme against art?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know at a glance that the man beside you eagerly agreeing with everything you say is desperate for you to beg others to blaspheme against <i>his</i> art for only a prettier penny, isn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#3$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're mad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is arguing with the audience part of his opening ceremony?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, he made a name for himself as a maverick, you can't deny that, can you? Can you, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, how dull. All he knows is fiddling with his terminals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Subdued) What a surprise, this bunch isn't any better. Hypocrites.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "El Capit\u00e1n covers the ominous glint in the corner of his eye, and puts on an expression of indifference before anyone can cotton on to him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, I am about to present the very first batch of CVAPs in all of Terra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beneath the podium, the crowd hushes for a spell."
    },
    {
        "text": "They've had an ample taste of Reynell's zero amenity to reason, but a man without reason is still a man, one who'd naturally want to maintain the privileged life he enjoys. Or to put it another way, he needs money too."
    },
    {
        "text": "The issue is the difference, and the difference is that the layperson who abides by the rules makes money in ways everyone can accept, and be amicable while doing it. The unreasonable sod, meanwhile, has a nasty habit of looking down on the rest while churning their cash."
    },
    {
        "text": "But no matter. As long as the sod still seeks money, the layperson will always find a chance to pick every last scrap of the madman's innards clean."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_223",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Sir, what should we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Let's see how this plays out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) See what collectibles he can wheel out for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) The intercity net isn't enough to sustain a new field of investment, but there's a chance this madman can strike some actual treasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) We've got ways to get what we want, anyhow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "These pieces brim with the kindness and hospitality and brightness and sheer beauty I've come to feel during my time in Dossoles. And so, they possess the geist of commemoration, one to forever elude comparison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I proudly present to you all\u2014'El Capit\u00e1n Molesto'!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_spotlight",
        "channel": 1,
        "Delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "48_i03",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 35,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "How... How is this worth anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Newbie Investor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're out of your mind! A rich kid with brainrot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Haughty Broker"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's over. It's all over. There's no art salon here. Why do I paint for a living...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Destitute Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, bro, that virtual artpiece or whatever, that one... I think Reynell based it on you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Spectator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "El Capit\u00e1n stands himself up, first looking at the terminal in his hand, then at the show screen, and finally at Reynell, whose line of sight meets his."
    },
    {
        "text": "Capit\u00e1n Mateo, in light of how jolly our first meeting was, I have one more gift for you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are going to be the model for the first CVAP in the entire history of Terra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, pick one. I'd be glad to grant it to you, free of charge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g3_galleriessquare_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "All eyes in the venue land on El Capit\u00e1n."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He does not immediately respond to Reynell. His first order of business is one more glance at his terminal."
    },
    {
        "text": "And finally, he sees the news he's been waiting for this entire time."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need, Se\u00f1or Reynell. You keep it for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "So sorry, everyone, but I have urgent news to announce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who're you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Spectator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am a representative of the Bol\u00edvaran Coalition Government in Dossoles, se\u00f1or.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "The latest news indicates a terrorist threat targeting the gallery is imminent. I ask you all to follow my instructions to get to safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reliable information suggests that rioters are charging our location at this very moment. Do please follow the soldiers under my command to shelter in the gallery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vague, on the horizon, are a notable number of silhouettes seemingly charging for the Galer\u00eda, apparently emerging with an indistinct jumbled chorus of singing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me, se\u00f1or.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! I need to find Candela and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Investor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
