    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not now. You, grab him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer's Subordinate"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Mateo, you really have furnished my opening ceremony with a tremendous surprise\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.03,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Men. I want you to haul him away, off to his favorite balcony to watch the sunrise. I'll have a talk with him later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, also, remember to make him climb the stairs himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Status?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've managed to intimidate\u2014sorry, <i>convince</i> the majority to accept our arrangements. We're relocating them to the Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa interior now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a few troublemakers unwilling to listen to us. You see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Troublemakers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the majority are inside, I want blades against their throats. See if they have the stomach to make trouble then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the street art people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll be here in a few minutes. Our plants there have succeeded in instigating them. Now we just wait for them to reach the plaza and carry out their atrocities, and they'll substantiate the terrorist attack claim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dawn is coming. We need to hurry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
